# phase5/out stays excluded, with a narrow exception for the canonical val-2025 grid: the
# write-up's encoder table is rebuilt from stress_grid_val2025_fixed.json directly rather than
# from transcribed figures, so that file is tracked. Everything else under phase5/out/ remains
# ignored, including the .PREV.json backup that run_val2025.sh writes.
phase5/out/*
!phase5/out/stress_grid_val2025_fixed.json

